Subject: [PATCH 01/25] Restore settings validation, wire auto-click, and add
 START.bat
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Settings could never be saved or reloaded because DesktopSettings.validate()
did not exist, which also blocked starting monitoring; click_region and
click_point are now rebuilt from JSON so the saved click area survives a
restart. Auto-click fires one click at the centre of the saved region for each
confirmed round at or above the threshold, dry-run by default, and START.bat
builds and launches the Windows exe.

