Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:42:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/25] Add a measured color-forecast click gate and a
 ten-minute review

The clicker now sits out rounds it cannot predict and only fires when the
forecast reaches the configured confidence, while the ten-click run after a
high round stays unconditional. Each review window logs forecast accuracy so
the gate is judged by measurement rather than belief.
