From 9c230849b14f232f8793b5193b03adfeb240962d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Buffy <buffy@freebuff.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:55:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/25] Cap every click wait at one second

The delay before a click must never exceed one second, so the setting is now
bounded 0-1000 ms and validated, old files with a larger value are clamped on
load, and the manual test click uses the same wait as the automatic one.
---
