 crash_watcher/desktop/config.py               | 22 +++++++++++--------
 crash_watcher/desktop/ui.py                   |  5 +++--
 tests/test_desktop.py                         | 11 ++++++++++
 ...31\201\330\247\330\261\330\263\333\214.md" |  2 +-
 6 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

