From 642d55bbb626022b700add71a0a1656b07dfebdf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Buffy <buffy@freebuff.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:04:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/25] Click after yellows when the chart shows two reds then
 two yellows

The user reads that shape as a signal, so the chart region is scanned for it and
arms two yellow follow-up clicks, once per appearance. While armed it outranks
the wait-then-burst rule so the signal is not swallowed by the run counter.
