 expect the model to sit near the base rates (red ≈ 50%, green ≈ 40%, yellow ≈ 10%) most of
 the time.
 
+**Chart signal (on by default).** When the trend chart shows a column of two reds with two
+yellows in the column next to it — the shape from the site's own screenshot — the clicker
+arms `signal_repeat` (default 2) follow-up clicks: every yellow round in that window is
+clicked immediately to bet on the round after it. The arm rises only when the shape appears
+after being absent, so the same chart cannot keep re-arming itself. Scans are read from
+`chart_region` (set it with «انتخاب شبکهٔ رنگ»); while the signal is armed it takes
+precedence over the wait-then-burst rule.
+
 ## Windows setup and execution
 
 Run in the project directory:
