From: Buffy <buffy@freebuff.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:15:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/25] Bet the opposite color after a red or green pair

Two same-colored dots in a row now arm one bet on the other color, and each
color can have its own captured button, so a rule can name the exact option it
wants instead of clicking whatever sits in the region centre.
---
