From: Buffy <buffy@freebuff.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:21:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/25] Click yellow when the same row repeats a yellow four
 columns later

The user reads that repetition as the next column turning up yellow in the same
row, so the following round is worth a yellow bet. The gap is configurable and
the rule applies to every row.
