index 2101658..accbcb0 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -40,6 +40,11 @@ yellow** from the top is read as "more yellows are on the way", and the clicker
 yellow on each of the next `signal_burst_rounds` rounds (default 9). Like the first signal
 it only arms on a rising edge and it does not click the round that shows the shape.
 
+**Row signal (on by default).** When the same row is yellow in two columns exactly
+`row_signal_gap` apart (default 4), the following round is clicked as a yellow bet: the user
+reads that repetition as the next column turning up yellow in the same row. It works for any
+row, and a fresh appearance is needed before it arms again.
+
 **Pair flip (on by default).** Two reds or two greens in a row (vertical neighbours) arm one
 bet on the opposite colour: after two greens the next round clicks the red button, after two
 reds the green one. Capture the three bet buttons once with «دکمهٔ قرمز / سبز / زرد»
