From 40d65888f262003e004f9037ffa683e24b23ae12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Buffy <buffy@freebuff.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:29:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/25] Write a per-rule session report the user can hand back

Each click now carries the rule that asked for it and is scored against the
colour that really followed, so the end-of-session report shows which rules earn
their clicks instead of only how many happened.
---
