+**Overnight session.** `session_minutes` (default 360) ends monitoring after that many
+minutes and writes the report; `shutdown_after_session` (default on) then runs
+`shutdown /s /t 60` on Windows, giving a minute to abort with `shutdown /a`. Set the
+length to 0 for an unlimited session, or turn the shutdown option off to keep the machine
+on after the report is written.
